    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An unquenchable wanderlust marked your youth, and you left home to travel as soon as you could. On the road, you met the adventurous conjurers of the Horizon Weavers, who taught you some of their teleportation magic to aid your explorations.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Constitution, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.DPLZdqs2WrFO4Zwe]{Portal Jumper}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Acrobatics and Survival</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWeaversToo]{Weaver's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepShortbow00]{Shortbow}, 20 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbamoArrows0000]{Arrows}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWeaversToo]{Weaver's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagMap00000000]{Map}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagQuiver00000]{Quiver}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 18 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
